"className":"Intro_intro__kvY3Y","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_text__1JkoM","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Seas Geosciences is a specialist offshore geoscience business supporting renewable energy projects around the world. Until now, it didn’t have a digital home of its own, with its presence sitting within the wider Woocheen website. We gave Seas a standalone identity, clearer voice and immersive new website that brings its expertise, technology and people into focus—taking users from a wide-open ocean view, past the BOS Princess and down to the seabed.<!-- notionvc: 294a3753-1710-49bd-800b-2d869ecf15cc --></p>\n"}}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_projectDetails__UWcsm","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_left__d8bha","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.15,"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn","children":"Industry"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Geosciences"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn","children":"Location"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Global"}]]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_right__E3UWy","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.15,"children":null}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"Intro_link__Wrq2r","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"delay":0.3,"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://seasgeosciences.com/","target":"_blank","style":{"backgroundColor":"#f26e4e","borderColor":"#f26e4e"},"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":"Visit site"}],["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","viewBox":"0 0 12.6 12.6","className":"Intro_buttonArrow___9UE0","children":[["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M11.85 12.6c-.41 0-.75-.34-.75-.75V1.5H.75C.34 1.5 0 1.16 0 .75S.34 0 .75 0h11.1c.41 0 .75.34.75.75v11.1c0 .41-.34.75-.75.75z"}],["$","path",null,{"fill":"#fff","d":"M1.13 12.21c-.19 0-.38-.07-.53-.22a.754.754 0 010-1.06L11.32.22c.29-.29.77-.29 1.06 0 .29.29.29.77 0 1.06L1.66 11.99c-.15.15-.34.22-.53.22z"}]]}]]}]}]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"ContentBuilder_contentBuilder__FAKQG","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"$undefined","data-margin":"default","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"SingleImage_containedImage__N2jLD","children":["$","$L1f",null,{"data":{"__typename":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","fieldGroupName":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","alignment":"contained","marginBottom":"default","loop":{"mediaItemUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/Iphone-On-Rocks-V6.mp4"},"fullVideo":null}}]}]}],false]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy","data-margin":"default","data-right-empty":"true","style":{"--brand-color":"red"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Giving the brand more depth</h2>\n<p>We refined the visual system, introduced a stronger typographic hierarchy and expanded the colour palette for digital use. Photography, 3D graphic elements and motion bring more of the working environment into the brand too. The overall feel is clean and technical, but there’s ambition, warmth and atmosphere in there. The result feels distinctly Seas: technically precise, grounded in the environments it works in, and confident without becoming corporate or over-polished.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 78e2d5ef-3e0b-42d5-bea9-4424d62c7dac --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"$undefined","data-margin":"default","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":["$","$L1f",null,{"data":{"__typename":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","fieldGroupName":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","alignment":"fullPageWidth","marginBottom":"default","loop":{"mediaItemUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/Seas-Type-Colour-V3.mp4"},"fullVideo":null}}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy","data-margin":"default","data-right-empty":"true","style":{"--brand-color":"red"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A voice built for complex decisions</h2>\n<p>Seas’ audience knows the work. They don’t need hype, over-explaining or vague reassurance; they need people that can provide clarity in complex environments. So we built the tone around three principles: <strong>clear, grounded and ambitious</strong>. It leads with the reality of the problem, uses active language and lets evidence carry the confidence. The result feels calm, capable and technically credible. Bold when it needs to be, but never loud. They sound like people making good decisions under pressure.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: b4c0052e-144f-4455-992a-200a1885752c --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_mediaGallery__vB7wJ ","data-margin":"default","style":{"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"children":["$","$L20",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_grid___30fo MediaGallery_layout1__6P6Mg","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_media1__9Ryxs","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[false,["$","$L1e",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/Onshore-V1.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_media2__Uc1vY","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[false,["$","$L1e",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/Onshore2-V1.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_media3__rEmNG","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[["$","$L21",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/geo-consultanting.jpg 1188w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/geo-consultanting-500x469.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/geo-consultanting-768x720.jpg 768w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/geo-consultanting.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1188,"height":1114}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],false]}],false,false]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy","data-margin":"default","data-right-empty":"true","style":{"--brand-color":"red"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Making consistency easier</h2>\n<p>A brand only works if people can use it without second-guessing every decision. We pulled the refreshed identity and new voice into an online, always-up-to-date practical set of guidelines covering logo use, typography, colour, imagery, graphics and verbal identity. That gives teams across the business a shared system to work from, whether they’re building a presentation, publishing an article or creating something for a new market.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 5b3d42ba-8084-4dd3-b5cc-9ef7d3a3e9a9 --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"$undefined","data-margin":"default","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"SingleImage_containedImage__N2jLD","children":["$","$L1f",null,{"data":{"__typename":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","fieldGroupName":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","alignment":"contained","marginBottom":"default","loop":{"mediaItemUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/Brand-Book-V3.mp4"},"fullVideo":null}}]}]}],false]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy","data-margin":"default","data-right-empty":"true","style":{"--brand-color":"red"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Scroll from the sky to the ocean floor</h2>\n<p>Seas wanted the site to make its working environment feel tangible and give its specialist vessels and equipment more impact, so we built the homepage around that idea. It opens on a wide ocean view with the <strong>BOS Princess</strong> at sea, then follows the user down through the water to the seabed below, passing schools of fish (and even a couple of whales!). The scroll turns Seas’ offshore world into part of the experience, using movement to bring scale, depth and technical capability to life.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 16ce65c8-9f6b-4e41-a46a-be73ed15d10a --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"$undefined","data-margin":"default","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":["$","$L1f",null,{"data":{"__typename":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","fieldGroupName":"Project_Singleproject_ContentBuilder_SingleVideo","alignment":"fullPageWidth","marginBottom":"default","loop":{"mediaItemUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/Dip-In-Sea-V6.mp4"},"fullVideo":null}}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy","data-margin":"default","data-right-empty":"true","style":{"--brand-color":"red"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Technology you can explore</h2>\n<p>Seas operates specialist vessels, CPT systems, drilling equipment and geotechnical labs. We wanted that technology to feel tangible rather than buried in technical copy. So the site gives its equipment room to breathe, using strong imagery, motion and detailed interface elements to show what it does and where it fits. From the BOS Princess to Nautilus-1 and MAKO-40, users can visually explore the capability behind the work.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: a45a7d0b-989d-4b2f-9911-1051e4408b13 --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_mediaGallery__vB7wJ ","data-margin":"default","style":{"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"children":["$","$L20",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_grid___30fo MediaGallery_layout1__6P6Mg","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_media1__9Ryxs","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[false,["$","$L1e",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/00-Assets-And-Equipment-V5.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_media2__Uc1vY","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[false,["$","$L1e",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/Assets-Equipment-Loop-V3.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_media3__rEmNG","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[false,["$","$L1e",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/Assets-Equipment-Loop-V2.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}]]}],false,false]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy","data-margin":"default","data-right-empty":"true","style":{"--brand-color":"red"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A digital home for what comes next</h2>\n<p>The website brings Seas’ services, equipment, projects, people and expertise into one clear digital home. It also gives the team room to keep building: adding case studies, publishing news, updating vessel information and supporting recruitment without relying on developers for every change. Most importantly, the experience makes a highly technical business easier to understand. You see where Seas works, how it thinks and what it brings to difficult offshore projects.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 8fb5e5f5-ff39-4edc-9aae-1da5ce8f9aa5 --></p>\n"}}]}]}],null]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_mediaGallery__vB7wJ ","data-margin":"default","style":{"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"children":["$","$L20",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_grid___30fo MediaGallery_layout1__6P6Mg","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_media1__9Ryxs","data-animation":"grid-item","children":[["$","$L21",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/projects-map-2-1400x835.jpg 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/projects-map-2-2000x1193.jpg 2000w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/projects-map-2-500x298.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/projects-map-2-768x458.jpg 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/projects-map-2-1536x916.jpg 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/projects-map-2-2048x1221.jpg 2048w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2026/08/projects-map-2.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":2448,"height":1460}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],false]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"MediaGallery_m